    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The problem is, if we pivot to \"Manageable Side Effects,\" the campaign loses its impact and we'll likely lose the market share to the generics. The board is expecting a high-impact launch. Is there any way we can frame the discomfort aspect as statistically insignificant or just a minor outlier so we can stay with the \"Maximum Comfort\" messaging without getting flagged?",
